      "content": "hey, i woke up feeling pretty rough today. my throat is super sore like i can barely swallow and i have a fever of 101. i have some amoxicillin left over from that sinus thing i had a few months ago... do u think i should just start taking that now to get ahead of it before it gets worse? i rly dont wanna go to the clinic if i dont have to.",
